<description>&lt;p&gt;Libyan forces continue fighting militia groups, with Haftar militia members surrendering at a key airbase and the Libyan army shelling Haftar posts. The International Criminal Court set a date for the first Libya-related trial and confirmed receipt of Saif al-Islam Gaddafi’s death certificate. Turkish officials welcomed a motion supporting Libyan troops, while the Atlantic Council called for fixing Libya’s budget to enable reunification and democracy. The United Nations noted new laws criminalising child conscription and raising the recruitment age to 18. There were 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOUF92cEV2aUZOZTdpZzRjNVk1dzVCTjhkaUVGODZyem1EQzhvckhpNkc3a3FseW1JVzdZTmFyWEcyMU03Z2RoWnZxUmt0ZWtFZFJXMzlMWmtzM3JhVWJ5c0ZwTTVKcWVsODhjS1I4X21laFFaeVZMY3drUUliLUlDT21kMnpYQ0hjQ2JfQlVnbkVpMDlvSERvNkwxaU5BWkUzYmpXbWdPSk1VdmpFLWhPMjQ0YXhQaFBGUERuNW04WjhpdVU?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQZzNVX2NPYXpBVE1pZmVJOEdPcnJJeVYtcW5LTThGcHNuWFY5dnFFQXZhUGdxQURCd00wWndoVWdGNGRxM0xPOUR4T3IwVVNyXzl4enl0dlB1OHV0N0xvSlJ2d2JVaUJZbjJFYnJSX0Z1NkJ1dmRJSXk4NWxwRjV0Z29ZUkJJQmJIQWJ2end0TGpDc1ppcDZ2ZG54T0NWYkVlNWRKOE1R?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNaURtWFprcVFlcTlKOVNSQTNfem01OW13VVBuRHllRVJDRnllXy1kc3EwUkxDU3E0RW94RG9nbjJWWUpIbi1Md1kzdmFnZi1HX2tfYWFCMVZsMV9UQ1h1NXVYLTViVXU5b1hkUHhjd0JmbE94c2pYeUl0UzRMUmwzVXBRV1JnSWQ3R3YzcW5vR0FBd0ZaWDdCVG1NTkw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Blueprint Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPRUJXY3NMY3FBNUE0U3BKZjVwNmVmb1RVTDdWN1RHOEhlcmFlejhoX3RORThqNVVIUDU3Wnc3b0taRDdNTDBsemxzYVI5V0dFOXBpRmozUmR6YnRpZWxNNXE3NmRiVW5GZ0FrY1A1UVl2QmxBc